#==============================================================================================
#
#   node_2 - Layout::NodeWithStyle: construction, image observers and edges
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/Node.cpp (lines 579-673): NodeWithStyle's two constructors, the
#       ImageObserver that repaints a node when one of its images updates,
#       rebuild_image_observers and NodeWithStyle::visit_edges.
#
#       An ImageObserver is a managed blob (`NonnullOwnPtr`, DESIGN.md §3.3). Its destructor
#       unregisters it from its image; the port does that where C++ destroys the observers,
#       when rebuild_image_observers replaces them.
